        <activityName xml:lang="en">Esters of versatic acid, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Esters of versatic acid, at plant
Production of versatic acid ester f(VeoVa-10). Inventory data are confidential.;
CAS number: 051000-52-3; 
Formula: C12H22O2; 
Synonyms: VeoVa-10, vinyl neodecanoate; 
UUID: 6f509fd5-88e3-3e43-b96a-a91c2bace699
Cradle-to-gate. Includes all ancillary materials, precursors, transports and infrastructure.
Location: RER
Technology: based on literature data and plant data in Europe 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: survey 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6f509fd5-88e3-3e43-b96a-a91c2bace699.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
